  "description": "Gemma's a sweet little girl... and also a dragon. She may look innocent with her curly hair and rosy cheeks, but deep down, she knows she’s a monster who can raze villages with a single breath. Because of this, she's hated and feared, even by those whom she once believed loved her. And then there’s Garin, the most ferocious dragon hunter (though a bit jaded) in all of Chrysos, now tasked with guiding Gemma to safe harbor. A mischievous dragon girl and a dragon hunter... what could go wrong? \n\n(Source: Tapas)",
